 "narration": {
  "voice": "Piper en-us-libritts-high, speaker 846 (CC BY 4.0)",
  "length_scale": 0.93,
  "lines": [
   {
    "i": 0,
    "text": "Imagine driving down a dark road...",
    "start": 0.6,
    "end": 2.446
   },
   {
    "i": 1,
    "text": "When suddenly, something with glowing red eyes starts following your car.",
    "start": 2.796,
    "end": 6.24
   },
   {
    "i": 2,
    "text": "This isn't just a horror story.",
    "start": 6.69,
    "end": 8.146
   },
   {
    "i": 3,
    "text": "It's one of America's most famous creature mysteries.",
    "start": 8.396,
    "end": 11.121
   },
   {
    "i": 4,
    "text": "The year was 1966.",
    "start": 11.571,
    "end": 13.67
   },
   {
    "i": 5,
    "text": "The location was Point Pleasant, West Virginia.",
    "start": 13.87,
    "end": 16.245
   },
   {
    "i": 6,
    "text": "On November 15, two young couples were driving near an abandoned wartime factory area, known as the TNT Area.",
    "start": 16.595,
    "end": 24.415
   },
   {
    "i": 7,
    "text": "Then they noticed something strange.",
    "start": 24.765,
    "end": 26.39
   },
   {
    "i": 8,
    "text": "A huge figure, standing near an old building.",
    "start": 26.69,
    "end": 28.977
   },
   {
    "i": 9,
    "text": "It looked almost human... but it had enormous wings, and two glowing red eyes.",
    "start": 29.327,
    "end": 33.79
   },
   {
    "i": 10,
    "text": "They accelerated.",
    "start": 34.29,
    "end": 35.172
   },
   {
    "i": 11,
    "text": "According to their account, the creature suddenly took flight, and followed their car.",
    "start": 35.422,
    "end": 39.239
   },
   {
    "i": 12,
    "text": "The witnesses reported the incident to the police.",
    "start": 39.639,
    "end": 41.995
   },
   {
    "i": 13,
    "text": "And soon, more people began describing similar encounters.",
    "start": 42.245,
    "end": 45.521
   },
   {
    "i": 14,
    "text": "Some claimed they saw it flying above trees.",
    "start": 45.821,
    "end": 47.98
   },
   {
    "i": 15,
    "text": "Others reported seeing it near roads and abandoned buildings.",
    "start": 48.13,
    "end": 51.072
   },
   {
    "i": 16,
    "text": "Newspapers began covering the mysterious figure.",
    "start": 51.422,
    "end": 54.696
   },
   {
    "i": 17,
    "text": "People gave it a name...",
    "start": 54.996,
    "end": 56.122
   },
   {
    "i": 18,
    "text": "The Mothman.",
    "start": 56.572,
    "end": 57.144
   },
   {
    "i": 19,
    "text": "But the story took a darker turn.",
    "start": 57.844,
    "end": 59.562
   },
   {
    "i": 20,
    "text": "On December 15, 1967, the Silver Bridge, connecting West Virginia and Ohio, collapsed into the freezing Ohio River.",
    "start": 59.962,
    "end": 68.35
   },
   {
    "i": 21,
    "text": "46 people died.",
    "start": 68.8,
    "end": 70.425
   },
   {
    "i": 22,
    "text": "After the disaster, some residents connected the Mothman sightings to the tragedy.",
    "start": 71.625,
    "end": 75.894
   },
   {
    "i": 23,
    "text": "They believed the creature was a warning of what was coming.",
    "start": 76.194,
    "end": 78.876
   },
   {
    "i": 24,
    "text": "But here's what the investigation actually found.",
    "start": 79.376,
    "end": 81.751
   },
   {
    "i": 25,
    "text": "The bridge collapsed because of a fracture in a critical steel suspension eyebar.",
    "start": 82.051,
    "end": 85.781
   },
   {
    "i": 26,
    "text": "There was no evidence that the Mothman caused, or predicted, the disaster.",
    "start": 86.131,
    "end": 90.222
   },
   {
    "i": 27,
    "text": "And despite decades of stories, nobody has produced scientifically verified proof that the creature existed.",
    "start": 90.522,
    "end": 96.317
   },
   {
    "i": 28,
    "text": "So what did those people see?",
    "start": 96.767,
    "end": 98.283
   },
   {
    "i": 29,
    "text": "A giant bird?",
    "start": 98.583,
    "end": 99.355
   },
   {
    "i": 30,
    "text": "A misidentified animal?",
    "start": 99.605,
    "end": 100.871
   },
   {
    "i": 31,
    "text": "Or something we still don't understand?",
    "start": 101.121,
    "end": 102.808
   },
   {
    "i": 32,
    "text": "The Mothman remains a mystery.",
    "start": 103.408,
    "end": 104.914
   },
   {
    "i": 33,
    "text": "And the question that keeps the legend alive is simple...",
    "start": 105.214,
    "end": 107.638
   },
   {
    "i": 34,
    "text": "What was flying over Point Pleasant?",
    "start": 108.088,
    "end": 109.584
   }
  ],
  "narration_end": 109.584
 },
